//Fate spirit dialogue

@1 /*Bodhi*/ = ~So, you wish me to hunt with you once again? Excellent. Let our prey fear the sound of our approach.~

@81936 = ~You'll have to hold onto this for me, CHARNAME, so that I may rest at your side.~

@59 /*Charname*/ = ~Bodhi, it seems your dear brother has created a "sister" for you. *chuckle*~ 
@60 /*Bodhi*/ = ~I feel... my soul is being torn apart... It... is becoming incomplete... No, no, that is my soul. I will not be controlled by others any longer.~ [BODHIX41.WAV]